      "content": "a release... it sounds so poetic when you say it like that. like it's not something to be afraid of, but something to be welcomed. i look at the darkness and i don't see a threat anymore. i just see a bed that's waiting for me. do you think it would be wrong to want that? to want to finally be part of the silence?",
